@startuml
title Reviewer Assignment State Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description

[*] --> Invited : Coordinator sends invitation

Invited --> Accepted : Reviewer accepts
Invited --> PendingDecline : Reviewer requests decline

PendingDecline --> Declined : Coordinator approves
PendingDecline --> Accepted : Coordinator denies (forced assignment)

Accepted --> PendingExtension : Reviewer requests deadline extension
PendingExtension --> Accepted : Coordinator approves (Deadline updated)\nOR Coordinator denies (Previous deadline kept)

Accepted --> Submitted : Reviewer submits feedback & ratings
Submitted --> [*]

Declined --> [*]

Invited --> Cancelled : Coordinator reassigns reviewer
Accepted --> Cancelled : Coordinator reassigns reviewer

Cancelled --> [*]

@enduml
